    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "man who scatters beans on Setsubun",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "今年の節分では、誰が豆男になって鬼を追い払うのか決まった？",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "豆男が「鬼は外、福は内」と叫びながら豆を撒く。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "豆男が撒いてくれた豆を、家族みんなで拾い集めた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "二　魂胆色遊懐男「魂胆色遊懐男」はかの「豆男江戸見物」のプロトタイプなり。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "案頭の書",
                "author": "芥川龍之介",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "江戸時代のエロ本に「豆男もの」というものがある。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "探偵小説の「謎」",
                "author": "江戸川乱歩",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "small man",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "彼は背が低くて「豆男」なんてあだ名で呼ばれている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "あんな小さな豆男が、実は誰よりも力持ちだとは驚きだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "忙しそうに走り回る豆男が、人混みに消えていった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "lewd little man",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "あんなにスケベな豆男には、絶対に近づかないほうがいいよ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "しつこく話しかけてくる豆男のせいで、せっかくの食事が台無しだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "彼は周囲から、陰で下品な豆男だと噂されている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
